---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="VolnLabs builds systems software for adaptive robots, including Actryn and the continuing AxiomOS research program.">
  <div class="min">
    <main id="main-content">
      <h1>Built where software meets hardware<span class="accent">.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">VolnLabs develops systems software for robots whose behavior is increasingly directed by AI.</p>

      <h2>What we build</h2>
      <div class="stack">
        <p><strong>Actryn is the current product focus.</strong> It grew from design-partner feedback asking for controlled execution that fits selected Linux environments and keeps existing driver stacks in place.</p>
        <p><strong>AxiomOS is continuing research.</strong> It explores the broader operating-system model for runtime-programmable robots and remains an active project.</p>
      </div>

      <h2>Founder</h2>
      <div class="stack">
        <p><strong>Utkarsh Maurya</strong> is a systems engineer working across kernels, embedded systems and runtime correctness. He built AxiomOS and Actryn.</p>
        <p>His prior work includes Bitcoin-only firmware for Cypherock X1, Linux multikernel research, and systems and evaluation work at Polymath (YC W26).</p>
      </div>

      <h2 id="open-source">Open source</h2>
      <p>VolnLabs develops <a href="https://github.com/volnlabs/actryn">Actryn</a> and <a href="https://github.com/volnlabs/axiomos">AxiomOS</a> in public. Utkarsh has also contributed to Limine and bpftime and maintains an rbpf fork.</p>

      <h2>Programs</h2>
      <p><a href="https://claude.com/programs/startups">Claude Startups</a> · Anthropic · 2026</p>
    </main>
  </div>
</Base>
